{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13102110","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13102110","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:3:1310211001:0":{"text":"哦嚯，老约恩！你看上去还是跟以前一样，像锻锤一样有精神！","source_cn":"哦嚯，老约恩！你看上去还是跟以前一样，像锻锤一样有精神！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA8CA6F5C0D26B86E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1310211002:0":{"text":"呼金，你总算是来了！你赶路的速度简直比我奶奶还慢！快点，我可没时间招呼你，大家都在赶工呢！","source_cn":"呼金，你总算是来了！你赶路的速度简直比我奶奶还慢！快点...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x65C62C37B06399DA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1310211003:0":{"text":"哎呀呀，你们到底接了什么活儿，叫我来帮忙不说，连祭典都顾不上参加了？","source_cn":"哎呀呀，你们到底接了什么活儿，叫我来帮忙不说，连祭典都...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBD58D776B104A9A1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1310211004:0":{"text":"就是为了祭典才赶工的！今年咱们负责给祭典雕刻英雄冰雕。现在倒好，冰雕没雕完不说，连燃芯也没法做了！","source_cn":"就是为了祭典才赶工的！今年咱们负责给祭典雕刻英雄冰雕。...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2EF8BDFDAF664350","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:7:1310211004":{"text":"就是为了祭典才赶工的！今年咱们负责给祭典雕刻英雄冰雕。现在倒好，冰雕没雕完不说，连燃芯也没法做了！","source_cn":"就是为了祭典才赶工的！今年咱们负责给祭典雕刻英雄冰雕。现在倒好，冰雕没雕完不说，连燃芯也没法做了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2EF8BDFDAF664350","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_recor